</p><p>리버스 시어링 방식으로 구워먹을 예정입니다.. ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>비약과 생략으로 인한 오류가 있을 수 있습니다.&#160;</p><p>알려주시면 감사드립니다!! ^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3b93b4690a01cd447ca5d39b9677a36b48f3eb04?download\" data-file-name=\"03.스테이크.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2504563\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D221%26fileid%3D16%26regdt%3D20200926160234&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3b93b4690a01cd447ca5d39b9677a36b48f3eb04')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">03</span><span class=\"type\">.스테이크</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.39MB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
